[Document Summary: The Multimodal-Textbook-6.5M dataset is designed for vision-language pretraining, featuring 6.5 million images interleaved with 0.8 billion text tokens from instructional videos covering subjects like mathematics, physics, and chemistry. This dataset, derived from 75,000 filtered videos (22,697 class hours), incorporates a blended format of keyframe images and ASR texts, facilitating rich context for machine learning models. The dataset includes comprehensive statistics and samples, with an 11GB JSON file and images totaling approximately 600GB. Users can access the dataset and its detailed annotations through provided links on GitHub and the project website.]

[Keywords: license, text-generation, summarization, multimodal, pre-training, keyframes, ASR texts, instructional videos, image-text aligning, dataset]

